            "review_title": "Review at Hu Tieu Nam Vang Thanh Dat",
            "review_text": "Quoc425\nSeattle, Washington1 contribution\n0\nOne of the best spots for Hu Tieu in Saigon\nFeb 2024 • Family\nOne of the best Hu Tieu I’ve tried in Saigon. The broth was super favorable and well balanced and a touch on the sweet side. The night we went they were out of egg noodles, but that didn’t change my experience. Super crowded, but super fast service. Highly recommended.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten February 13, 2024",
